          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilawaco rijo ni: Me nono ma jokwero winjo dwondi Rwoth Were pajo, aka jokwero winjo fonji; adieri ongoye kwoŋ jo; otiek kwanyo woko wok i dhok jo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.28",
