          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Delkwoŋ ji me labedo cemo pa winyin ma koyo, kodi ri ogwaŋe ma piny; aka ongoye ŋata lamiyo jo lworo. ",
          "type": "text",
